  {
    "slide": 20,
    "source_sha256": "ab7efabed9af6dec3f902abc3a0143f0301a0383fdce951490fd26e869d5ef1f",
    "summary": "Three tops, two bottoms, and two shoe pairs give twelve outfits under compatibility assumptions.",
    "issues": [],
